[00:15.64]1. Raise your eyes up and see,
[00:23.44]Far above the highest hill.
[00:26.44]There stands Jehovah’s mountain
[00:29.44]Lifted up in this day.
[00:32.78]People come from afar,
[00:36.98]Ev’rywhere from sea to sea,
[00:41.18]Calling to one another,
[00:44.01]‘Come serve God and obey.’
[00:46.85]Now the time has arrived
[00:50.40]For the small, a great nation to be.
[00:58.96]As we grow and we thrive,
[01:03.80]God’s direction and blessing we see.
[01:08.68]Millions now come to God
[01:13.18]And accept his sov’reignty.
[01:17.68]Loyal they vow to be
[01:20.68]And from his side never stray.
[01:23.68]2. Jesus gave the command
[01:45.98]To go forth and preach the word.
[01:54.98]Good news about the Kingdom
[01:59.48]Reaches all men today.
[02:03.98]Christ now rules from above,
[02:09.38]Urging all to take his side.
[02:13.38]Meek ones who hear his voice
[02:17.58]Let God’s Word show them the way.
[02:22.65]It brings joy to the heart,
[02:27.30]As the great crowd continues to grow.
[02:31.95]And we all have a part,
[02:36.94]As we strive to let ev’ryone know.
[02:41.93]Let us lift up the voice,
[02:43.29]Calling out for all to hear,
[02:47.29]‘Come to Jehovah’s mountain,
[02:51.29]Here forever to stay.’